      247.75,
      192.41,
      352.05,
      203.75
    ],
    "text": "Statement of Legal Effect",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      144.31,
      213.53,
      455.9,
      260.87
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause amends section 2 of the Prevention of Frauds Ordinance(Chapter 70) and the legal effect of the section as amended is to provide aprocedure which would facilitate the prevention of forgery in respect of theexecution of a deed of transfer.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,BoldItalic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.61,
      192.61,
      228.32,
      203.68
    ],
    "text": "L.D. - O. 8/2023",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      164.85,
      228.61,
      397.97,
      251.68
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE PREVENTION OF FRAUDSORDINANCE (CHAPTER 70)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.61,
      272.65,
      397.09,
      295.72
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.61,
      304.69,
      401.14,
      327.76
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Prevention of Frauds(Amendment) Act, No. of 2023.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.61,
      336.61,
      401.24,
      359.68
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 2 of the Prevention of Frauds Ordinance(Chapter 70) is hereby amended as follows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      178.65,
      368.65,
      354.36,
      391.72
    ],
    "text": "(1) by the renumbering of that section assubsection (1);",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      178.65,
      400.69,
      400.18,
      423.76
    ],
    "text": "(2) by the addition, immediately after subsection (1) of that section, of the following new subsection: -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      213.69,
      432.61,
      352.41,
      443.68
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(2) In relation to a transfer deed \u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      228.69,
      452.65,
      401.15,
      499.72
    ],
    "text": "(a) both the transferor and the transfereeshall affix their signatures and thumbimpressions as required by subsection(1):",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      246.69,
      508.69,
      401.17,
      591.76
    ],
    "text": "Provided however, where thetransferee is unable to be present andexecute the deed or instrument, he shallauthorise in writing, any other personto sign such deed or instrument on hisbehalf, who shall comply with therequirements set out in subsection (1):",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      246.69,
      600.61,
      401.16,
      659.68
    ],
    "text": "Provided further, where thetransferee is a corporate body and wherethe Board of Directors of suchcorporate body is unable to be presentand execute the deed or instrument,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
